# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# KALSHI ↔ POLYMARKET ARBITRAGE BOT — CREDENTIALS
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your credentials.
# This file is safe to commit. Your real .env is gitignored.
#
# See docs/API_KEYS.md for step-by-step key generation instructions.

# ── Polymarket US (CFTC-Regulated Exchange) ──────────────────────
# Generate at: https://polymarket.us/developer
# Auth method: Ed25519 signatures (no wallet/passphrase needed)
POLYMARKET_US_KEY_ID="your_polymarket_us_key_id_here"
POLYMARKET_US_SECRET="your_polymarket_us_ed25519_secret_here"

# ── Kalshi (CFTC-Regulated Exchange) ─────────────────────────────
# Generate at: https://kalshi.com/settings/api
# Auth method: RSA-SHA256-PSS signed timestamps
KALSHI_API_KEY_ID="your_kalshi_api_key_id_here"
KALSHI_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH="path/to/your_kalshi_key_here.pem"
KALSHI_PRIVATE_KEY_CONTENT=""

# ── Dashboard Authentication (Optional but Recommended) ──────────
# Required for remote access via SSH tunnel or public IP
DASHBOARD_USERNAME=""
DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=""
